<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's IGCP places no 364-day bills.</title>
<headline>Portugal's IGCP places no 364-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Public Credit Management Institute (IGCP) said it placed no 364-day bills at today's auction.</p>
<p>It previously placed the bills at an average weighted interest rate of 5.9985 percent.</p>
</text>
